    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππήλᾰτ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit for horsemanship</i>
			or <i>driving</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.607
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.242
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδὸς ἱ</span>.
			<i>chariot</i>-road, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ. οἶδμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					20.157
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλασσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agath.
					4.29
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ. ἔργον Ἀθήνης</span>, i.e.
			the Trojan horse, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δι᾽ ἡδονῆς καθάπερ ἱ. τι χωρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Marc.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
